son_invalid_t:`{thing} isn't valid JSON`,pc_json_invalid_c:`{where} has a JSON syntax error.`,pc_json_invalid_q:`Claude Code can't use what this file sets until the error is fixed.`,pc_not_object_t:`{thing} doesn't hold a JSON object`,pc_not_object_c:`The top level of {file} isn't a JSON object, so nothing in it can be read.`,pc_not_object_q:`Claude Code can't use what this file sets.`,pc_not_object_c_key:`In {file}, {key} isn't a JSON object.`,pc_managed_invalid_t:`Managed settings can't be read`,pc_managed_invalid_c:`{where} isn't valid JSON, or its top level isn't an object.`,pc_managed_invalid_q:`Claude Code may not apply your organization's settings as intended.`,pc_value_invalid_t:`{thing} has a value Claude Code rejects`,pc_value_invalid_c:`{where} sets {key} to {value}, which Claude Code doesn't accept.`,pc_value_invalid_q:`Claude Code drops this value, so it doesn't apply.`,pc_frontmatter_invalid_t:`{thing} has front matter Claude Code can't read`,pc_frontmatter_invalid_c:`{where} starts front matter that isn't valid YAML.`,pc_frontmatter_invalid_q:`Claude Code can't read the settings in it.`,pc_agent_no_name_t:`{thing} has no name`,pc_agent_no_name_c:`{where} starts front matter with no name.`,pc_agent_no_name_q:`Claude Code skips this agent.`,pc_agent_no_description_t:`{thing} has no description`,pc_agent_no_description_c:`{where} starts front matter with no description.`,pc_agent_no_description_q:`Claude Code skips this agent.`,pc_agent_not_md_t:`{thing} isn't a Markdown file`,pc_agent_not_md_c:`{file} is in an agents folder, but Claude Code reads only .md files there.`,pc_agent_not_md_q:`Claude Code skips it.`,pc_same_name_in_folder_t:`{thing} is defined twice in one folder`,pc_same_name_in_folder_c:`{file} and {other_file} use the same name.`,pc_same_name_in_folder_q:`Claude Code loads only one of them.`,pc_same_name_in_folder_c_nofile:`Another file in this folder uses the same name.`,pc_skill_no_md_t:`Skill folder {thing} has no SKILL.md`,pc_skill_no_